# Copy this file to .env in this folder and fill in the token. .env is listed in .gitignore; this template is tracked.
# The token is needed only for the gated Llama checkpoints that T1.1.1 and T1.1.2 can load; Qwen3.5-4B and
# bge-large-en-v1.5 download without one. Create a read token at https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens after
# accepting the Llama licences on the Hub. Never paste it into a notebook.
